'''Merchants''' are [[Non-Playable-Character|NPCs]] that can be found all throughout [[Sacred Grove]] and [[Sunstone Valley]]. Previously, they were the only way to access certain [[Station Cash Marketplace|SC Marketplace]] and the [[Coin Shop]] [[Items|items]]. Currently most of those merchants bring players to the default [[Coin Shop]] or to the coin shop in the category of their appropriate items.

As of August 6 of 2013, merchants that sell [[Jobs]] specific Coin Shop items have been introduced to the game.

